---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="Terms of Use | NuRenaissance"
  description="The rules for using the NuRenaissance website, services and apps."
>
  <article class="doc">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="meta">
      This website and its apps are run by NuRenaissance Media, a sole proprietorship in Nashville, Tennessee.<br />
      Last Updated: November 22, 2026
    </p>
    <h2>What this covers</h2>
    <p>The NuRenaissance website (nrnszn.com), its services, events and media pages, the NuRenaissance account, and the apps we run: Certified, NuDirectory, luoh and Soul Vault. Some of those have their own short terms as well. By using the Site you agree to these terms.</p>
    <h2>Services and quotes</h2>
    <p>Sending a request or a form is not a contract. Work is agreed in writing (an estimate, invoice or message from us) before it starts, and that agreement is what counts. Prices on the Site are guides.</p>
    <h2>Payments</h2>
    <p>Card and wallet payments are handled by payment services such as Stripe, PayPal, Cash App and Venmo, under their own terms. We never see your card details.</p>
    <h2>Events and tickets</h2>
    <p>Event details can change. Tickets are often sold by other companies, and their terms apply to your purchase.</p>
    <h2>Your NuRenaissance account</h2>
    <p>One account signs you in to this Site and our apps. Give us accurate details, keep your sign-in links private, and tell us if you think someone else has used your account. We can limit or close an account that is abused, and you can delete yours from the account page.</p>
    <h2>Content</h2>
    <p>The Site's pictures, videos, text and design belong to NuRenaissance Media or the artists and people credited. Videos from YouTube and other services belong to their owners. Please ask before reusing anything.</p>
    <h2>Fair use</h2>
    <p>Don't try to break, overload, scrape at high volume or bypass the security of the Site, and don't use it for anything unlawful.</p>
    <h2>Links and third parties</h2>
    <p>The Site links to and embeds services we don't run (YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Apple Music and others). We are not responsible for them.</p>
    <h2>No guarantees</h2>
    <p>The Site is provided "as is" and "as available", with no promise that it will always work, be accurate or be error-free. To the fullest extent the law allows, NuRenaissance Media is not liable for losses that come from using it.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms; the date above changes when we do, and continuing to use the Site means you accept the update. Questions or removal requests: nurrenaissance@gmail.com.</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </article>
</Site>

<style>
  .doc {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #e6e0f2;
  }
  .doc h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 7vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    color: var(--gold-300);
  }
  .doc .meta { color: #a99fc6; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 var(--space-6); }
  .doc h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-2);
    color: #f3f0fa;
  }
  .doc p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .doc ul { margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .doc li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .doc a { color: var(--gold-300); }
  .doc strong { color: #f3f0fa; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
